spans.s:
Gaganagañja (or Gagaṇa˚, so in LV 〔295.10〕; Mvy 〔1336〕, but ˚na 〔700〕; ˚ṇa Kv 〔38.13 ff., 49.17 ff.〕, but ˚na 〔39.8〕),
(1) n. of a Bodhisattva: one of eight Bʼs, Dharmas 〔12〕; Mmk 〔62.13〕; one of sixteen, Mmk 〔40.13〕; otherwise named Mvy 〔700〕; LV 〔295.10〕; Śikṣ 〔127.1〕 (from Dharma-saṃgītisūtra); Mmk 〔68.21〕; 〔406.3〕; Sādh 〔49.16〕; Kv, see above;
(2) m., n. of a work: Mvy 〔1336〕 Gagaṇagañjaḥ, prob. = ˚ja-paripṛcchā, see note ad loc. and note on Śikṣ 〔33.11〕, or ˚ja-sūtra, q.v.;
(3) n. of a samādhi (one of four listed): Dharmas 〔136〕 (˚ṇa˚ or ˚na˚).

Gaganagarbha,
(1) n. of a Bodhisattva: Gv 〔2.24〕;
(2) n. of a dhāraṇī: Gv 〔66.19〕.

Gaganabuddhi,
(1) n. of a Bodhisattva: Gv 〔4.12〕;
(2) n. of a Buddha: Gv 〔257.2〕.
